    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE MUNICIPAL COUNCILS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 252)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      244.13,
      401.9,
      268.79
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      284.33,
      401.75,
      308.99
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Municipal Councils(Amendment) Act, No of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      324.53,
      401.91,
      376.07
    ],
    "text": "2. The following section to be inserted immediately followingSection 10(2)(b) of the No. 29 of 1947 Municipal CouncilsOrdinance as amended by Act, No. 19 of 1987 (Chapter 252) andshall have effect as Section 10 (2) (c) of that enactment :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.049875259399414
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.81,
      391.25,
      401.9,
      493.55
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(c) Where a Local Authority election is declared andthe said election cannot be held due to a crisis thathas arisen, the relevant dissolved local authority/body may be reconvened by the Minister for a periodas decided at the Minister\u2019s discretionnotwithstanding the lapse of the twelve (12) monthsextension made by the Minister in terms of Section10 (2) (b).\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      507.53,
      401.85,
      531.47
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
